<h2>If you are the last person to leave this room, please take a minute and check the following:</h2>

* All soldering irons turned off
* All tools returned to their proper places
* Workspace you were using is clean
* Window blinds closed
* All lights turned off
* Additionally, we remind you: workbenches are NOT project storage. Put your project up in an appropriate storage area.

We thank you for your effort, together we can make Bloominglabs a better place for everyone to use.


